[ti:Literally Unplayable]
[ar:Mippithedork]
[offset:-500]

[00:04.26]Three hundred hours
[00:07.48]Not a single regret
[00:11.26]Until I saw something
[00:13.91]I can't forget
[00:27.19]Seven years of waiting for a masterpiece
[00:30.09]A hundred little reasons I could never leave
[00:32.94]I loved the world, I loved the atmosphere
[00:36.18]Then something happened that I couldn't bear
[00:39.28]A floating rock, a foot above the ground
[00:41.94]I took a screenshot, passed it around
[00:45.19]The whole damn internet deserves to know
[00:48.17]That somebody forgot to move a stone!
[00:51.62]You call it minor, I call it a crime
[00:54.55]You say it's harmless, I say it's a sign
[00:57.86]If this is what they let us see
[01:00.51]Then what else could be wrong underneath?!
[01:03.88]LITERALLY UNPLAYABLE!
[01:06.67]COMPLETELY UNFORGIVABLE!
[01:09.67]You broke my heart, you broke my trust
[01:12.65]And left perfection in the dust!
[01:15.74]I gave you everything I had
[01:18.55]Three hundred hours, and now I'm mad!
[01:21.97]One little flaw, and who's to blame?
[01:24.50]I'm never playing this game again!
[01:31.58]The combat's flawless and the story's great
[01:34.31]I stayed up playing 'til a quarter past eight
[01:37.54]The music's perfect, every quest's a thrill
[01:40.46]But I saw a guard walk straight through a windowsill
[01:43.47]A physics glitch sent a body through the roof
[01:46.36]I caught it on camera, I've got the proof
[01:49.49]One frame of clipping, now I've seen enough
[01:52.54]How could professionals release this stuff?!
[01:56.10]You call it minor, I call it a crime
[01:59.20]You say it's harmless, I say it's a sign
[02:02.21]A texture popped in act three
[02:05.18]And now the whole damn industry's dead to me!
[02:08.47]LITERALLY UNPLAYABLE!
[02:10.98]COMPLETELY UNFORGIVABLE!
[02:14.11]You broke my heart, you broke my trust
[02:17.10]And left perfection in the dust!
[02:20.29]I gave you everything I had
[02:22.98]Three hundred hours, and now I'm mad!
[02:26.44]One little flaw, and who's to blame?
[02:28.80]I'm never playing this game again!
[02:33.56]I miss the days of perfect games
[02:36.58]Before the patches and the shame
[02:39.76]When every pixel knew its place
[02:42.89]And nothing ever broke in space
[02:48.10]I've seen the glitches
[02:49.34]I've seen the lies
[02:51.04]I've seen a ponytail
[02:52.47]Pass through a thigh!
[02:54.10]REFUND! REFUND! REFUND! REFUND!
[02:57.38]I WANT THE LEAD DEVELOPER
[02:59.06]TO LOOK ME IN THE EYES!
[03:02.17]LITERALLY UNPLAYABLE!
[03:04.76]COMPLETELY UNFORGIVABLE!
[03:07.76]I loved your world, I loved your story
[03:11.34]But one bad frame destroyed your glory!
[03:14.27]I gave you everything I had
[03:16.68]Four hundred hours, and now I'm mad!
[03:20.31]One little flaw, and who's to blame?
[03:22.58]I'm never playing this game again!
[03:29.72]I'm done with you
[03:32.76]I'm moving on
[03:35.79]Three hundred hours
[03:39.33]Of trust are gone
